{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-childrens-non-toxic-water-beads-100g-2511-0237","content_id":"5a216383-994c-472c-a5d4-fb7783f3a895","description":"Product Recall for Children's Non Toxic Water Beads presenting a high risk of asphyxiation.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"3139aeba-6bfc-4542-afd8-42b7e004823a","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-11-27T17:19:46+00:00","id":"3139aeba-6bfc-4542-afd8-42b7e004823a","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-11-27T17:19:46+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/692888319c1eda2cdf034239/2511-0237-product-recall-water-beads-badger.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Children’s Non Toxic Water Beads 100g</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The products present a high risk of asphyxiation as they can block a young child’s airway if swallowed in hydrated form.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users and withdrawn from the market.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys – Water Beads</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product code (On Packaging)</td>\n      <td>TT-SMA-SPHE-MIX-DGOC</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product name (On Packaging)</td>\n      <td>Smart Water Spheres Mix Dk Green Orange Clear 10g</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Small dehydrated water beads in transparent plastic packaging with white labelling. Product is CE and UKCA marked.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_3139aeba-6bfc-4542-afd8-42b7e004823a\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/692888319c1eda2cdf034239/2511-0237-product-recall-water-beads-badger.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of asphyxiation because if the product is swallowed in its hydrated form, it can block a young child’s airway.</p>\n\n<p>OPSS has published a Product Safety Alert for water beads, which can be accessed at: <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-water-beads-psa7.\">https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-water-beads-psa7</a>  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by Badger Office Supplies Limited.</p>\n\n<p>Owners are advised to stop using the product immediately and keep it out of reach of young children. Contact the distributor you purchased from to request redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0237</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-27T17:20:40Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-11-27","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-11-27T17:20:40+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-childrens-non-toxic-water-beads-100g-2511-0237","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-childrens-non-toxic-water-beads-100g-2511-0237","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-childrens-non-toxic-water-beads-100g-2511-0237","content_id":"5a216383-994c-472c-a5d4-fb7783f3a895","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-11-27T17:20:40Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Children's Non Toxic Water Beads 100g (2511-0237)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-childrens-non-toxic-water-beads-100g-2511-0237","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_risk_level","name":"Risk level","preposition":"that are","short_name":"Risk level","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Adaptors, Plugs and Sockets","value":"ada